#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: the node answered without the fixed read script framing. Its key may not be limited to a forced command running pfs-read.sh."
msgstr "%s: nóòdù dáhùn láìsí ìṣètò ìwé-àṣẹ kíkà tí a yàn. Kọ́kọ́rọ́ rẹ̀ lè má ní ìdíwọ́ sí àṣẹ dandan tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ pfs-read.sh."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: the node host key is not in the known hosts file, or it changed. Check the key before adding it."
msgstr "%s: kọ́kọ́rọ́ olùgbàlejò nóòdù kò sí nínú fáìlì àwọn olùgbàlejò tí a mọ̀, tàbí ó yí padà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò kọ́kọ́rọ́ náà kí o tó fi kún un."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: the endpoint resolves outside the networks allowed for poller %d, so it is not read."
msgstr "%s: ìparí ìsopọ̀ yanjú síta àwọn nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì tí a gbà láàyè fún olùwádìí %d, nítorí náà a kò kà á."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: the read script printed %d parameters the plugin does not read, so it is not the shipped pfs-read.sh. The node may be exposing more than the plugin needs."
msgstr "%s: ìwé-àṣẹ kíkà tẹ %d àwọn pàrámítà jáde tí àfikún kò kà, nítorí náà kì í ṣe pfs-read.sh tí a fi ránṣẹ́. Nóòdù náà lè máa ṣí ohun tí ó pọ̀ ju èyí tí àfikún nílò sílẹ̀."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: %d target names in the node output did not match the expected pattern or filesystem and were ignored."
msgstr "%s: %d àwọn orúkọ ibi àfojúsùn nínú àbájáde nóòdù kò bá àpẹẹrẹ tàbí ètò fáìlì tí a retí mu, a sì kọ̀ wọ́n sílẹ̀."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader on poller %d has not completed a run in the last %d seconds. Values from its nodes are getting stale."
msgstr "Olùka lórí olùwádìí %d kò tíì parí ìṣiṣẹ́ kan láàárín %d ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá sẹ́yìn. Àwọn iye láti àwọn nóòdù rẹ̀ ń di àtijọ́."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Installing the Parallel Filesystem templates failed: %s"
msgstr "Fífi àwọn àdàkọ Parallel Filesystem sí i kùnà: %s"

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
msgid "The Parallel Filesystem templates are not installed, so no device can be added."
msgstr "A kò fi àwọn àdàkọ Parallel Filesystem sí i, nítorí náà a kò lè fi ẹ̀rọ kankan kún un."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data query file resource/script_server/%s is missing from Cacti or differs from the one this plugin ships, so the data queries cannot list targets."
msgstr "Fáìlì ìbéèrè dátà resource/script_server/%s sọnù kúrò nínú Cacti tàbí ó yàtọ̀ sí èyí tí àfikún yìí fi ránṣẹ́, nítorí náà àwọn ìbéèrè dátà kò lè to àwọn ibi àfojúsùn."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Filesystem %s is mapped to device %d, which no longer exists."
msgstr "Ètò fáìlì %s wà ní ìsopọ̀ pẹ̀lú ẹ̀rọ %d, tí kò sí mọ́."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The device of filesystem %s is polled by poller %d, but its nodes are read by poller %d, whose cache the device's data sources need."
msgstr "Ẹ̀rọ ti ètò fáìlì %s wà lábẹ́ ìwádìí olùwádìí %d, ṣùgbọ́n olùwádìí %d ló ń ka àwọn nóòdù rẹ̀, tí àwọn orísun dátà ẹ̀rọ náà nílò àpamọ́ rẹ̀."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SSH key file %s does not exist on this server."
msgstr "Fáìlì kọ́kọ́rọ́ SSH %s kò sí lórí olùpèsè yìí."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SSH key file %s can be read or written by users other than its owner (mode %s). Limit it to the poller user."
msgstr "Àwọn olùṣàmúlò mìíràn yàtọ̀ sí oní rẹ̀ lè ka tàbí kọ sínú fáìlì kọ́kọ́rọ́ SSH %s (ipò %s). Dín i kù sí olùṣàmúlò olùwádìí nìkan."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The known hosts file %s does not exist on this server, so no node can be read from it."
msgstr "Fáìlì àwọn olùgbàlejò tí a mọ̀ %s kò sí lórí olùpèsè yìí, nítorí náà a kò lè ka nóòdù kankan láti inú rẹ̀."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SSH client %s does not exist on this server."
msgstr "Oníbàárà SSH %s kò sí lórí olùpèsè yìí."

#: lib/NodeInput.php
msgid "Filesystem: choose one of the registered filesystems."
msgstr "Ètò Fáìlì: yan ọ̀kan lára àwọn ètò fáìlì tí a forúkọ sílẹ̀."

#: lib/NodeInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Orúkọ: lo lẹ́tà, nọ́ńbà, àmì ìdádúró, ìlà àárín, tàbí ìlà ìsàlẹ̀ 1 sí 64, kí ó sì bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà tàbí nọ́ńbà."

#: lib/NodeInput.php
msgid "Role: choose one of the listed roles."
msgstr "Ipa: yan ọ̀kan lára àwọn ipa tí a tò sílẹ̀."

#: lib/NodeInput.php
msgid "Port: enter a port from 1 to 65535."
msgstr "Èbúté: tẹ èbúté láti 1 sí 65535."

#: lib/NodeInput.php
msgid "Login Name: use a lower-case account name of at most 32 characters, starting with a letter or underscore."
msgstr "Orúkọ Ìwọlé: lo orúkọ àkọọ́lẹ̀ lẹ́tà kékeré tí kò ju lẹ́tà 32 lọ, tí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà tàbí ìlà abẹ́."

#: lib/NodeInput.php
msgid "Endpoint: enter a host name or an IP address only, without a user, port, or path."
msgstr "Ìparí Ìsopọ̀: tẹ orúkọ olùgbàlejò tàbí àdírẹ́sì IP nìkan, láìsí olùṣàmúlò, èbúté, tàbí ipa-ọ̀nà."

#: lib/NodeInput.php
msgid "Endpoint: the name does not resolve on this server."
msgstr "Ìparí Ìsopọ̀: orúkọ náà kò yanjú lórí olùpèsè yìí."

#: lib/NodeInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Endpoint: it resolves to %s, which is not inside the networks allowed for this poller. Add the network first."
msgstr "Ìparí Ìsopọ̀: ó yanjú sí %s, tí kò sí nínú àwọn nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì tí a gbà láàyè fún olùwádìí yìí. Fi nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì kún un kọ́kọ́."

