msgid "The response ended before the read script finished"
msgstr "Ìdáhùn náà parí kí ìwé-àṣẹ kíkà tó parí"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Access"
msgstr "Ìwọlé Nóòdù"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the ssh client on each poller that reads nodes."
msgstr "Ipa-ọ̀nà kíkún sí oníbàárà ssh lórí olùwádìí kọ̀ọ̀kan tí ń ka àwọn nóòdù."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SSH Client"
msgstr "Oníbàárà SSH"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path, on each poller that reads nodes, to the private key whose public half each node lists in authorized_keys with a forced command running pfs-read.sh. Readable only by the poller user. The plugin never creates, copies, or prints it."
msgstr "Ipa-ọ̀nà kíkún, lórí olùwádìí kọ̀ọ̀kan tí ń ka àwọn nóòdù, sí kọ́kọ́rọ́ àdáni tí nóòdù kọ̀ọ̀kan to apá gbogbogbòò rẹ̀ sínú authorized_keys pẹ̀lú àṣẹ dandan tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ pfs-read.sh. Olùṣàmúlò olùwádìí nìkan ló lè kà á. Àfikún náà kì í ṣẹ̀dá, ṣe ẹ̀dà, tàbí tẹ̀ ẹ́ jáde láé."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SSH Key File"
msgstr "Fáìlì Kọ́kọ́rọ́ SSH"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the known_hosts file holding each node host key under the node endpoint name. A node whose key is missing or changed is not read."
msgstr "Ipa-ọ̀nà kíkún sí fáìlì known_hosts tí ó di kọ́kọ́rọ́ olùgbàlejò nóòdù kọ̀ọ̀kan mú lábẹ́ orúkọ ìparí ìsopọ̀ nóòdù. A kì í ka nóòdù tí kọ́kọ́rọ́ rẹ̀ sọnù tàbí yí padà."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Known Hosts File"
msgstr "Fáìlì Àwọn Olùgbàlejò Tí A Mọ̀"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìdádúró Ìsopọ̀"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds to wait for a node to accept the connection."
msgstr "Àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá láti dúró de nóòdù láti gba ìsopọ̀ náà."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Read Timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìdádúró Kíkà"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node read may take in total before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tí kíkà nóòdù kan lè gbà lápapọ̀ kí a tó dá a dúró kí a sì kọ ọ́ sílẹ̀ bíi ìkùnà."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one node may return. A larger answer is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "KiB tí nóòdù kan lè dá padà. A máa ń ju ìdáhùn tí ó tóbi jù nù kí a sì kọ ọ́ sílẹ̀ bíi ìkùnà."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response"
msgstr "Ìdáhùn Púpọ̀ Jù Lọ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Olùka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Ìṣúná Àkókò Olùka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend before it stops starting node reads. Keep it below the poller interval; unread nodes are read on the next run."
msgstr "Àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tí ìṣiṣẹ́ olùka kan lè lò kí ó tó dá bẹ̀rẹ̀ àwọn kíkà nóòdù dúró. Jẹ́ kí ó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ àlàfo olùwádìí; a ó ka àwọn nóòdù tí a kò kà ní ìṣiṣẹ́ tókàn."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Concurrent Reads"
msgstr "Àwọn Kíkà Lẹ́ẹ̀kan Náà"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node reads one reader runs at the same time."
msgstr "Àwọn kíkà nóòdù tí olùka kan ń ṣiṣẹ́ ní àkókò kan náà."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Yọ kúrò"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Pa Àwọn Tábìlì Àfikún Mọ́ Nígbà Yíyọ Kúrò"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its filesystems, nodes, inventory, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the registry first from the Parallel Filesystem Admin page. Storage nodes are never contacted either way."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá yàn án, yíyọ àfikún kúrò yóò pa àwọn ètò fáìlì, àwọn nóòdù, àkójọpọ̀, àti àpamọ́ rẹ̀ mọ́. Kó o kúrò láti jẹ́ kí yíyọ kúrò pa wọ́n rẹ́; kó ìforúkọsílẹ̀ jáde kọ́kọ́ láti ojú-ewé Alákòóso Parallel Filesystem. A kì í kàn sí àwọn nóòdù ìpamọ́ láé lọ́nà méjèèjì."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delete the Devices This Plugin Created on Uninstall"
msgstr "Pa Àwọn Ẹ̀rọ Tí Àfikún Yìí Ṣẹ̀dá Rẹ́ Nígbà Yíyọ Kúrò"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin deletes the devices it created for filesystems, with their graphs and data sources, as deleting them in Cacti would. Existing devices that were mapped to a filesystem are never deleted. RRD files are removed only if Cacti's own RRD cleanup setting removes them. Cleared, the devices stay."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá yàn án, yíyọ àfikún kúrò yóò pa àwọn ẹ̀rọ tí ó ṣẹ̀dá fún àwọn ètò fáìlì rẹ́, pẹ̀lú àwọn àwòrán àti orísun dátà wọn, bí pípa wọ́n rẹ́ nínú Cacti yóò ti rí. A kì í pa àwọn ẹ̀rọ tí ó ti wà tẹ́lẹ̀ tí a so pọ̀ mọ́ ètò fáìlì rẹ́ láé. A máa ń yọ àwọn fáìlì RRD kúrò nìkan bí ètò ìfọ̀mọ́ RRD ti Cacti fúnra rẹ̀ bá yọ wọ́n kúrò. Tí a kò bá yàn án, àwọn ẹ̀rọ náà yóò wà."

