#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device, its data queries, and its overview graphs were created."
msgstr "A ti ṣẹ̀dá ẹ̀rọ náà, àwọn ìbéèrè dátà rẹ̀, àti àwọn àwòrán àkópọ̀ rẹ̀."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device is no longer mapped. It and its graphs were kept; its data queries list no targets until it is mapped again."
msgstr "Ẹ̀rọ náà kò sí ní ìsopọ̀ mọ́. A pa òun àti àwọn àwòrán rẹ̀ mọ́; àwọn ìbéèrè dátà rẹ̀ kò to ibi àfojúsùn kankan títí a ó fi tún un so pọ̀."

